meta {
  name: 16. Pay Card Maintenance Fee
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{cardId}}/maintenance/pay
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "transactionPin": "1234"
  }
}

docs {
  # Pay Card Maintenance Fee

  Allows the card owner to pay an outstanding monthly maintenance fee from
  their main NGN wallet.

  The backend:

  1. verifies the transaction PIN
  2. fetches the current USD-to-NGN rate
  3. debits the exact NGN equivalent
  4. clears the overdue status
  5. unfreezes the Maplerad card only when it was frozen for maintenance
  6. schedules the next monthly due date
  7. sends an email and in-app success notification

  ## Success Response

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Card maintenance fee paid and card restored",
    "card": {
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "maintenancePastDue": false,
      "maintenanceGraceEndsAt": null,
      "frozenForMaintenance": false,
      "maintenanceStatus": "CURRENT",
      "nextMaintenanceAt": "..."
    },
    "wallet": {},
    "transaction": {}
  }
  ```

  ## Common Errors

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Card maintenance fee is not currently due"
  }
  ```

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Insufficient wallet balance"
  }
  ```

  Show the Pay button when `maintenancePastDue` is `true`.
}
